WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.456
Changing support people or classes. Here is what that means.

2
00:00:06.456 --> 00:00:13.080
One person who helps us leaves. This can feel like losing a step.

3
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:18.912
It is okay to feel odd about it, even if we never talked much.

4
00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:24.600
A new person arrives. They will not know us yet.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:31.104
The notes about what helps us move with us. The notes are ours.

6
00:00:31.104 --> 00:00:36.816
We can read the notes with the new person, once, at the start.

7
00:00:36.816 --> 00:00:43.560
We do not have to explain ourselves from zero. The notes do that.

8
00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:49.776
Slowly, the new person learns us, and things feel steady again.

9
00:00:49.776 --> 00:00:57.984
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

